(function(E){ const x = E["exam-02"] = E["exam-02"] || {units:{}}; (x.units = x.units || {})["x02-l2"] = {"id":"x02-l2","patterns":["L2-tours","PARA-place"],"title":{"en":"Listening Part 2: a guide and a map","tr":"Listening Part 2: bir rehber ve bir harita","fa":"Listening Part 2: یک راهنما و یک نقشه"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to choose TWO answers from five while a guide talks about places to visit, and to label a map by following the speaker’s route from the entrance.","tr":"Bu derste bir rehber gezilecek yerleri anlatırken beş seçenekten İKİ cevabı seçmeyi ve konuşanın girişten başlayan rotasını takip ederek bir haritayı etiketlemeyi öğreneceksin.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک راهنما از جاهای دیدنی حرف می‌زند، از پنج گزینه دو جواب را انتخاب کنی و با دنبال کردن مسیر گوینده از ورودی، روی نقشه برچسب بگذاری."},"sessions":[["explain"],["drill"],["exit"]],"explain":{"title":{"en":"Listening Part 2: a guide and a map","tr":"Listening Part 2: bir rehber ve bir harita","fa":"Listening Part 2: یک راهنما و یک نقشه"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to choose TWO answers from five while a guide talks about places to visit, and to label a map by following the speaker’s route from the entrance.","tr":"Bu derste bir rehber gezilecek yerleri anlatırken beş seçenekten İKİ cevabı seçmeyi ve konuşanın girişten başlayan rotasını takip ederek bir haritayı etiketlemeyi öğreneceksin.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک راهنما از جاهای دیدنی حرف می‌زند، از پنج گزینه دو جواب را انتخاب کنی و با دنبال کردن مسیر گوینده از ورودی، روی نقشه برچسب بگذاری."},"stats":[{"label":{"en":"Questions","tr":"Soru","fa":"سؤال"},"value":"10"},{"label":{"en":"Speakers","tr":"Konuşan","fa":"گوینده"},"value":"1"},{"label":{"en":"Map letters","tr":"Haritadaki harfler","fa":"حرف‌های نقشه"},"value":"A-I"}],"context":{"eyebrow":{"en":"1 The context","tr":"1 Bağlam","fa":"۱ بافت"},"head":{"en":"This exam: a valley visitor centre","tr":"Bu sınav: bir vadinin ziyaretçi merkezi","fa":"این آزمون: مرکز بازدیدکنندگانِ یک دره"},"intro":{"en":"Part 2 is one speaker giving practical information to a group. Tours and visitor sites are the most frequent Part 2 situation, and they often come with a map. Learn the place words on the card: the map task is built on them.","tr":"Part 2, bir gruba pratik bilgi veren tek bir konuşmacıdır. Turlar ve ziyaret yerleri Part 2’de en sık çıkan durumdur ve çoğu zaman bir haritayla gelir. Karttaki yer bildiren kelimeleri öğren: harita görevi bunların üzerine kuruludur.","fa":"Part 2 یک گوینده است که به یک گروه اطلاعات کاربردی می‌دهد. تور و مکان‌های دیدنی پرتکرارترین موقعیت Part 2 هستند و اغلب با یک نقشه می‌آیند. کلمه‌های مکانیِ کارت را یاد بگیر: تمرین نقشه روی همین‌ها ساخته شده."},"technique":{"en":"2 The technique","tr":"2 Teknik","fa":"۲ تکنیک"},"labels":{"asks":{"en":"What this part is about","tr":"Bu kısım ne hakkında","fa":"این بخش درباره‌ی چیست"},"fields":{"en":"Headings you will see","tr":"Göreceğin başlıklar","fa":"عنوان‌هایی که می‌بینی"},"words":{"en":"Words that carry the answers","tr":"Cevabı taşıyan kelimeler","fa":"کلمه‌هایی که جواب را می‌آورند"},"a":{"en":"On the paper","tr":"Kâğıtta","fa":"روی برگه"},"b":{"en":"What you hear or read","tr":"Duyduğun ya da okuduğun","fa":"چیزی که می‌شنوی یا می‌خوانی"},"traps":{"en":"Traps","tr":"Tuzaklar","fa":"دام‌ها"},"example":{"en":"Example","tr":"Örnek","fa":"نمونه"},"ideas":{"en":"Ideas","tr":"Fikirler","fa":"ایده‌ها"}},"cards":[{"id":"x02-l2-ctx","exam":true,"patterns":["L2-tours","PARA-place"],"often":{"pattern":"L2-tours","n":13,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 13 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 13’ünde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۱۳ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}},"title":{"en":"A guide talks about a valley","tr":"Bir rehber bir vadiyi anlatıyor","fa":"راهنمایی که از یک دره می‌گوید"},"asks":{"en":"A ranger welcomes visitors and describes three things to do: a walk, a trail past old buildings and a museum. First two choose-TWO questions, then a map of the museum site with letters to match to places.","tr":"Bir korucu ziyaretçileri karşılıyor ve yapılacak üç şeyi anlatıyor: bir yürüyüş, eski binaların önünden geçen bir rota ve bir müze. Önce iki tane iki-seçenekli soru, sonra harfleri yerlerle eşleştireceğin bir müze alanı haritası.","fa":"یک جنگلبان به بازدیدکننده‌ها خوشامد می‌گوید و سه کار را توضیح می‌دهد: یک پیاده‌روی، مسیری از کنار ساختمان‌های قدیمی و یک موزه. اول دو سؤال «دو گزینه را انتخاب کن» و بعد نقشه‌ی محوطه‌ی موزه با حرف‌هایی که باید به مکان‌ها وصل کنی."},"fields":["The walk","The trail","Rules","Times and prices","The map: entrance","The map: buildings","The map: water"],"words":[{"a":"suitable for wheelchairs","b":"step-free / with a smooth surface","tr":"tekerlekli sandalyeye uygun","fa":"مناسب ویلچر"},{"a":"allow (time)","b":"it takes at least / give yourself","tr":"(zaman) ayırmak","fa":"(وقت) در نظر گرفتن"},{"a":"on a lead","b":"tied, not running free","tr":"tasmalı","fa":"با قلاده"},{"a":"free for children","b":"children go free / no charge for under-12s","tr":"çocuklar ücretsiz","fa":"برای بچه‌ها رایگان"},{"a":"private","b":"people live there / not open to visitors","tr":"özel, ziyarete kapalı","fa":"خصوصی، برای بازدید باز نیست"},{"a":"the first building on the right","b":"just on your right as you come in","tr":"hemen sağında","fa":"درست سمت راستت"},{"a":"opposite","b":"across from / facing","tr":"karşısında","fa":"روبه‌روی"},{"a":"beside","b":"right next to / by","tr":"yanında","fa":"کنارِ"},{"a":"the far bank","b":"the other side of the water","tr":"karşı kıyı","fa":"آن طرف آب"},{"a":"landing stage","b":"where the boats stop","tr":"iskele","fa":"اسکله‌ی کوچک"},{"a":"to the west of","b":"on the left side of the map","tr":"batısında","fa":"در غربِ"},{"a":"sheltered","b":"out of the wind","tr":"rüzgâr almayan, korunaklı","fa":"دور از باد، سرپناه‌دار"}],"traps":[{"en":"\"People often assume...\" or \"a lot of visitors think...\" usually comes before the wrong idea. The fact comes after it.","tr":"\"People often assume...\" ya da \"a lot of visitors think...\" genelde yanlış fikirden önce gelir. Doğru bilgi ondan sonra gelir.","fa":"«People often assume...» یا «a lot of visitors think...» معمولاً قبل از ایده‌ی غلط می‌آید. واقعیت بعدش گفته می‌شود."},{"en":"A place that has moved: \"It used to be by the gate, but now it’s...\" On the map, mark the new place only.","tr":"Yeri değişmiş bir yer: \"Eskiden kapının yanındaydı ama şimdi...\" Haritada yalnızca yeni yeri işaretle.","fa":"جایی که عوض شده: «قبلاً کنار در بود، اما الان...». روی نقشه فقط جای جدید را علامت بزن."},{"en":"Left and right depend on the way you are facing. Follow the speaker’s route on the map before you decide.","tr":"Sol ve sağ, hangi yöne baktığına bağlıdır. Karar vermeden önce konuşanın rotasını haritada takip et.","fa":"چپ و راست به جهتی بستگی دارد که رو به آن ایستاده‌ای. قبل از تصمیم، مسیر گوینده را روی نقشه دنبال کن."}],"example":{"lines":[["Guide","The café is on your left as you come in. Bike hire used to be right next to it, but now it’s at the end of the lake path."]],"item":"Where is the bike hire? A by the entrance  B next to the café  C at the end of the lake path","answer":"C","why":{"en":"\"Used to be\" next to the café is the old place. \"Now it’s at the end of the lake path.\"","tr":"Kafenin yanı eski yer (\"used to be\"). \"Şimdi göl yolunun sonunda.\"","fa":"کنار کافه جای قبلی است («used to be»). «الان در انتهای مسیر دریاچه است»."}}},{"id":"L2-tours","ctx":["L2-tours"],"title":{"en":"Tours and visitor information","tr":"Turlar ve ziyaretçi bilgileri","fa":"تورها و اطلاعات بازدیدکننده"},"asks":{"en":"A guide or presenter tells visitors about a place: a heritage walk, a castle, a museum, a stadium, a boat trip. Questions ask about its history, what is new, what visitors can do, the rules and what the guide recommends.","tr":"Bir rehber ya da sunucu ziyaretçilere bir yeri anlatır: tarihî bir yürüyüş, bir kale, bir müze, bir stadyum, bir tekne gezisi. Sorular yerin tarihini, yeniliklerini, ziyaretçilerin neler yapabileceğini, kuralları ve rehberin tavsiyesini sorar.","fa":"یک راهنما یا مجری جایی را برای بازدیدکننده‌ها معرفی می‌کند: یک پیاده‌روی تاریخی، یک قلعه، یک موزه، یک ورزشگاه، یک گردش با قایق. سؤال‌ها درباره‌ی تاریخچه، چیزهای تازه، کارهایی که بازدیدکننده می‌تواند بکند، قانون‌ها و توصیه‌ی راهنماست."},"fields":["What was the building originally used for?","What has changed recently?","What does the guide recommend?","Which TWO activities are available today?","What are visitors not allowed to do?","What can visitors see in each area?"],"words":[{"a":"originally built as","b":"it started life as","tr":"aslen ... olarak yapılmış","fa":"در اصل به‌عنوان ... ساخته شده"},{"a":"restored","b":"brought back to how it looked","tr":"restore edilmiş","fa":"مرمت‌شده"},{"a":"exhibition","b":"the display / what's on show","tr":"sergi","fa":"نمایشگاه"},{"a":"not allowed","b":"please don't / you can't","tr":"yasak","fa":"ممنوع"},{"a":"recommend","b":"if you only have time for one thing","tr":"tavsiye etmek","fa":"توصیه کردن"},{"a":"recently opened","b":"it's only been open since","tr":"yeni açılmış","fa":"تازه باز شده"},{"a":"guided","b":"someone will take you round","tr":"rehberli","fa":"با راهنما"},{"a":"free","b":"it won't cost you anything","tr":"ücretsiz","fa":"رایگان"},{"a":"closed for repairs","b":"work is being done on","tr":"onarım için kapalı","fa":"به‌خاطر تعمیر بسته"},{"a":"souvenirs","b":"things to take home","tr":"hediyelik eşya","fa":"سوغاتی"},{"a":"most popular","b":"what people enjoy most","tr":"en popüler","fa":"پرطرفدارترین"},{"a":"the view","b":"you can see right across","tr":"manzara","fa":"منظره"}],"traps":[{"en":"Past and present: \"this was once the stables; today it’s the cafe\". The question usually asks about now.","tr":"Geçmiş ve şimdi: \"burası eskiden ahırdı; bugün kafe\". Soru genelde şimdiyi sorar.","fa":"گذشته و حال: «اینجا قبلاً اصطبل بود؛ امروز کافه است». سؤال معمولاً درباره‌ی حالاست."},{"en":"Every option is mentioned; one is \"temporarily closed\" or \"coming next year\".","tr":"Her seçenek söylenir; biri \"geçici olarak kapalı\" ya da \"gelecek yıl geliyor\" olur.","fa":"همه‌ی گزینه‌ها گفته می‌شوند؛ یکی «موقتاً بسته» است یا «سال آینده می‌آید»."},{"en":"Choose TWO: three activities are named, but one is only for groups or children.","tr":"İki seçenek seç: üç etkinlik sayılır ama biri yalnızca gruplar ya da çocuklar içindir.","fa":"انتخاب دو گزینه: سه فعالیت گفته می‌شود، ولی یکی فقط برای گروه‌ها یا بچه‌هاست."}],"example":{"lines":[["Guide","Many visitors head straight for the tower, and the view from the top is lovely."],["Guide","But if you only have time for one thing, I’d say go to the kitchens."],["Guide","They’re the oldest part of the castle and still have the original ovens."]],"item":"What does the guide recommend?  A the tower   B the kitchens   C the gardens","answer":"B","why":{"en":"The tower is popular, but \"if you only have time for one thing, I’d say\" introduces the recommendation: the kitchens.","tr":"Kule popüler ama \"if you only have time for one thing, I’d say\" tavsiyeyi getiriyor: mutfaklar.","fa":"برج پرطرفدار است، ولی «if you only have time for one thing, I’d say» توصیه را معرفی می‌کند: آشپزخانه‌ها."}},"general":true,"patterns":["L2-tours"],"often":{"pattern":"L2-tours","n":13,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 13 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 13’ünde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۱۳ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}}},{"id":"L2-map-heritage","ctx":["L2-map-heritage","L2-tours"],"title":{"en":"Heritage and visitor sites","tr":"Tarihî yerler ve ziyaretçi alanları","fa":"مکان‌های تاریخی و بازدیدی"},"asks":{"en":"A guide shows visitors round a castle, a mill, an old house or an archaeology site. You label rooms or areas such as the ticket office, the shop, the old kitchens, an exhibition or a viewing platform.","tr":"Bir rehber ziyaretçileri bir kalede, bir değirmende, eski bir evde ya da bir kazı alanında gezdirir. Bilet gişesi, dükkân, eski mutfaklar, bir sergi ya da seyir terası gibi odaları veya alanları etiketlersin.","fa":"یک راهنما بازدیدکننده‌ها را در یک قلعه، یک آسیاب، یک خانه‌ی قدیمی یا یک محوطه‌ی باستانی می‌گرداند. اتاق‌ها یا جاهایی مثل باجه‌ی بلیت، فروشگاه، آشپزخانه‌های قدیمی، نمایشگاه یا سکوی تماشا را برچسب می‌زنی."},"fields":["Ticket office","Gift shop","Exhibition room","Old kitchens","Viewing platform","Excavation site","Gardens"],"words":[{"a":"ground floor","b":"downstairs / at street level","tr":"zemin kat","fa":"طبقه‌ی همکف"},{"a":"courtyard","b":"the open square in the middle","tr":"avlu","fa":"حیاط"},{"a":"tower","b":"the tall round building","tr":"kule","fa":"برج"},{"a":"exhibition","b":"the display room","tr":"sergi","fa":"نمایشگاه"},{"a":"walls","b":"the old stone walls round the site","tr":"surlar","fa":"دیوارهای قدیمی"},{"a":"gate","b":"the way in through the walls","tr":"kapı","fa":"دروازه"},{"a":"excavation","b":"where they are digging","tr":"kazı alanı","fa":"محل کاوش"},{"a":"wing","b":"the east side of the house","tr":"kanat","fa":"بال ساختمان"},{"a":"straight ahead","b":"in front of you as you walk","tr":"dümdüz ileride","fa":"درست جلوی رو"},{"a":"to the left of","b":"on its left side","tr":"... -in solunda","fa":"سمت چپِ"},{"a":"just inside","b":"as soon as you go through","tr":"hemen içeride","fa":"درست بعد از ورود"},{"a":"between","b":"with one on each side","tr":"arasında","fa":"بین"}],"traps":[{"en":"Rooms on two floors: the plan shows one floor, so ignore what is \"upstairs\".","tr":"İki katlı odalar: plan tek katı gösterir; \"üst kattakileri\" boş ver.","fa":"اتاق‌ها در دو طبقه: پلان فقط یک طبقه را نشان می‌دهد، پس چیزهای «طبقه‌ی بالا» را نادیده بگیر."},{"en":"\"Opposite the shop\" and \"next to the shop\" are different letters. Check the side.","tr":"\"Dükkânın karşısında\" ile \"dükkânın yanında\" farklı harflerdir. Hangi tarafta olduğuna bak.","fa":"«روبه‌روی فروشگاه» و «کنار فروشگاه» دو حرف متفاوت‌اند. سمتش را چک کن."}],"example":{"lines":[["Guide","Once you’re through the main gate, the courtyard is straight ahead."],["Guide","The shop is just inside the gate on your right."],["Guide","And the cafe is opposite it, on the left."]],"item":"Cafe: ___   (plan: gate at the bottom, courtyard in the middle; A just inside the gate on the right, B just inside the gate on the left, C beyond the courtyard)","answer":"B","why":{"en":"The shop is A. \"Opposite it, on the left\" is B.","tr":"Dükkân A. \"Opposite it, on the left\" B’dir.","fa":"فروشگاه A است. «Opposite it, on the left» یعنی B."}},"general":true,"patterns":["L2-tours"],"often":{"pattern":"L2-tours","n":13,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 13 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 13’ünde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۱۳ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}}}]},"points":[{"eyebrow":{"en":"In the exam","tr":"Sınavda","fa":"در آزمون"},"head":{"en":"Two pairs, then a map","tr":"İki çift soru, sonra bir harita","fa":"دو جفت سؤال، بعد یک نقشه"},"body":{"en":"Questions 11-12 and 13-14 each ask you to choose TWO letters from A-E. Then there is a short break to look at the map. Questions 15-20 are six places; the map has nine letters, A-I, so three are not used.","tr":"Soru 11-12 ve 13-14’ün her biri A-E arasından İKİ harf seçmeni ister. Sonra haritaya bakman için kısa bir ara var. Soru 15-20 altı yer; haritada dokuz harf var (A-I), yani üçü kullanılmaz.","fa":"سؤال‌های ۱۱-۱۲ و ۱۳-۱۴ هر کدام می‌خواهند از A تا E دو حرف انتخاب کنی. بعد یک مکث کوتاه برای نگاه کردن به نقشه هست. سؤال‌های ۱۵ تا ۲۰ شش مکان‌اند؛ نقشه نُه حرف دارد (A تا I)، پس سه تا استفاده نمی‌شوند."}},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The method","tr":"Yöntem","fa":"روش"},"head":{"en":"Walk the map with your pencil","tr":"Haritada kalemle yürü","fa":"با مداد روی نقشه راه برو"},"steps":[{"en":"In the reading time, find the starting point and the big printed features: the gate, the paths, the water.","tr":"Okuma süresinde başlangıç noktasını ve büyük basılı öğeleri bul: kapı, yollar, su.","fa":"در زمان خواندن، نقطه‌ی شروع و چیزهای بزرگِ چاپ‌شده را پیدا کن: در ورودی، مسیرها، آب."},{"en":"Put your pencil on the start and move it as the speaker walks: \"carry on up\", \"cross over\", \"go back\".","tr":"Kalemini başlangıca koy ve konuşan yürüdükçe onu hareket ettir: \"carry on up\", \"cross over\", \"go back\".","fa":"مدادت را روی نقطه‌ی شروع بگذار و همراه حرکت گوینده جابه‌جایش کن: «carry on up»، «cross over»، «go back»."},{"en":"Listen for the position word: on your right, opposite, beside, at the end of, to the west of.","tr":"Konum kelimesine kulak ver: on your right, opposite, beside, at the end of, to the west of.","fa":"به کلمه‌ی موقعیت گوش بده: on your right، opposite، beside، at the end of، to the west of."}]},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The trap","tr":"Tuzak","fa":"دام"},"head":{"en":"Five options, all mentioned","tr":"Beş seçenek, hepsinden söz edilir","fa":"پنج گزینه، از همه حرف زده می‌شود"},"body":{"en":"In a choose-TWO question the speaker usually mentions every option. Three are ruled out: something that used to be true, something people wrongly believe, or something true only in part. Tick an option only when the whole option matches.","tr":"İki seçenekli bir soruda konuşan genelde her seçenekten söz eder. Üçü elenir: eskiden doğru olan bir şey, insanların yanlış inandığı bir şey ya da yalnızca bir kısmı doğru olan bir şey. Bir seçeneği ancak tamamı uyuyorsa işaretle.","fa":"در سؤالِ «دو گزینه» گوینده معمولاً از همه‌ی گزینه‌ها حرف می‌زند. سه تا رد می‌شوند: چیزی که قبلاً درست بود، چیزی که مردم به غلط باور دارند، یا چیزی که فقط بخشی از آن درست است. فقط وقتی گزینه‌ای را علامت بزن که تمامش جور باشد."}}],"example":{"eyebrow":{"en":"Worked example","tr":"Çözümlü örnek","fa":"مثال حل‌شده"},"head":{"en":"One map label, step by step","tr":"Bir harita etiketi, adım adım","fa":"یک برچسب نقشه، قدم به قدم"},"instruction":"Label the map below. Write the correct letter, A-C, next to the question.","item":"Map of a garden: the gate is at the bottom; A is on the left of the gate, B on the right, C at the end of the long path. Where is the information board?","lines":[["Guide","The shop is on your right as you come in. The information board was next to it, but we’ve moved it to the end of the long path."]],"answer":"C","walk":[{"en":"Start at the gate at the bottom of the map.","tr":"Haritanın altındaki kapıdan başla.","fa":"از دری که پایین نقشه است شروع کن."},{"en":"\"On your right as you come in\" is the shop (B), not the board.","tr":"\"Girerken sağında\" dükkân (B), pano değil.","fa":"«سمت راستت وقتی وارد می‌شوی» مغازه است (B)، نه تابلو."},{"en":"\"Was next to it, but we’ve moved it\" means the old place; the board is now at the end of the long path: C.","tr":"\"Yanındaydı ama taşıdık\" eski yeri anlatıyor; pano şimdi uzun yolun sonunda: C.","fa":"«کنارش بود، اما جابه‌جایش کردیم» جای قبلی است؛ تابلو الان انتهای مسیر بلند است: C."}]},"quick":{"prompt":"You hear: \"Some people think the walk is very steep, but in fact it’s quite gentle. It does get busy at weekends, though.\" Which option is true?","options":["It is very steep.","It is closed at weekends.","It gets crowded at weekends."],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"\"Very steep\" is what some people think; \"in fact it’s quite gentle\". \"It does get busy at weekends\" = crowded.","tr":"\"Çok dik\" bazılarının düşündüğü şey; \"aslında oldukça hafif eğimli\". \"Hafta sonları kalabalık oluyor\" = crowded.","fa":"«خیلی شیب‌دار» چیزی است که بعضی‌ها فکر می‌کنند؛ «در واقع شیبش ملایم است». «آخر هفته‌ها شلوغ می‌شود» یعنی crowded."}},"remember":{"en":"Choose TWO: tick only options that fully match. Map: start at the entrance and move with the speaker.","tr":"İki seçenek: yalnızca tamamen uyanları işaretle. Harita: girişten başla ve konuşanla birlikte ilerle.","fa":"دو گزینه: فقط گزینه‌هایی را علامت بزن که کامل جورند. نقشه: از ورودی شروع کن و همراه گوینده جلو برو."},"type":"explain","id":"c-x02-l2-e","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-02","unit":"x02-l2"},"drill":{"type":"drill","skill":"listening","part":"Listening Part 2","title":{"en":"Wenbury Valley Visitor Centre","tr":"Wenbury Vadisi Ziyaretçi Merkezi","fa":"مرکز بازدیدکنندگان دره‌ی ونبری"},"timed":7,"ctx":["L2-tours"],"script":[{"who":"Guide","line":"Good morning, everyone, and welcome to the Wenbury Valley Visitor Centre. My name's Rafe, and I'm one of the rangers here. Before you set off, I'd like to tell you about the three main ways to explore the valley today: the river walk, the mill trail and, of course, the canal museum."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Let's start with the river walk. It follows the River Wen from here all the way down to the village of Linford Bridge. People often ask whether the path is suitable for wheelchairs and buggies. The first mile is, because the surface was improved last year, but after the weir the path becomes narrow and quite muddy, so I'm afraid it isn't suitable for the whole route."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Most visitors expect it to take a couple of hours, but I'd allow at least three, because there's a lot to stop and look at. In particular, keep your eyes open as you get near the old stone footbridge. That's where kingfishers nest, and if you're patient you've got a very good chance of seeing one."},{"who":"Guide","line":"There used to be a tea room at the far end, in Linford Bridge, but sadly it closed last winter, so do take a drink with you. And one rule: dogs are very welcome, but they must be kept on a lead for the whole walk, because there are sheep in the fields beside the river all year round. The bus back from Linford Bridge runs every hour."},{"who":"Guide","line":"The second option is the mill trail. In the nineteenth century this valley had more than twenty woollen mills, and the trail takes you past three of the best preserved. You don't need to book, and you don't need a guide: you just follow the blue signs."},{"who":"Guide","line":"The trail leaflet costs two pounds from the desk behind me, and children under twelve go free. At the first mill, Harrow Mill, our volunteers start the old waterwheel every afternoon at two o'clock, and it's a wonderful sight when the whole wheel begins to turn, so try to time your visit for that."},{"who":"Guide","line":"The second mill on the trail, Fenwick Mill, is a lovely building, and a lot of visitors assume it's a hotel. It isn't. It was turned into private flats about ten years ago, so please don't try to go inside. The third mill is just a ruin, but it's a good spot for photographs."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Right. Now let's turn to the canal museum. If you look at the map I've given you, you'll see the main gate at the bottom, with the car park just outside it. The canal runs along the top of the map, and there's one path, the central path, that goes straight up from the gate to the lock."},{"who":"Guide","line":"As you come through the main gate, the first building you'll need is the ticket office. That's the small brick building immediately on your right. On your left, opposite it, is the gift shop, which also sells fishing permits if anyone's interested."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Walk up the central path and you'll see the big warehouse on your left. That's where the main galleries are. The café isn't in the middle of it, as people tend to think. It's at the top end of the warehouse, right next to the path, so you can't miss it."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Carry on up to the canal and you'll come to the lock. The toilets are on the canal bank to the west of the lock. Boat trips leave from the landing stage right beside the lock, on its east side. The trips run every forty minutes and last about half an hour."},{"who":"Guide","line":"For families, the children's play area used to be next to the car park, but parents told us it was too close to the traffic. So it's been moved to the middle of the lawn, which is on the right of the central path, where parents can sit on the grass and keep an eye on things."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Now, if you go to the right along the canal bank, you'll reach the footbridge. Cross over it to the far bank, and the blacksmith's forge is right there at the end of the bridge. There's a demonstration at eleven and another at three."},{"who":"Guide","line":"And finally, if you've brought your own lunch, the picnic area is on the west side of the warehouse, the side furthest from the path, where there are tables beside the old stone wall. It's sheltered there, even on a windy day."},{"who":"Guide","line":"Right, I think that's everything. Enjoy your day in the valley, and do come and see us at the desk if you have any questions."}],"map":{"title":"Wenbury Canal Museum","orientation":"north at the top","coords":"0-100 from the top-left corner","features":[{"label":"Canal","type":"water","from":[0,12],"to":[100,12]},{"label":"Lock","type":"lock","at":[50,12]},{"label":"Footbridge","type":"bridge","from":[82,17],"to":[82,6]},{"label":"Central path","type":"path","from":[50,95],"to":[50,16]},{"label":"Main gate","type":"gate","at":[50,97]},{"label":"Car park","type":"parking","at":[25,97]},{"label":"Warehouse","type":"building","box":[15,35,30,40]},{"label":"Lawn","type":"lawn","box":[56,35,34,40]},{"type":"wall","around":true}],"letters":[{"l":"A","at":[44,88]},{"l":"B","at":[56,88]},{"l":"C","at":[10,55]},{"l":"D","at":[42,37]},{"l":"E","at":[73,55]},{"l":"F","at":[40,18]},{"l":"G","at":[58,18]},{"l":"H","at":[82,20]},{"l":"I","at":[82,3]}]},"groups":[{"instruction":"Questions 11-12. Choose TWO letters, A-E.","qtype":"mcq2","questions":[{"n":11,"n2":12,"kind":"mcq2","prompt":"Which TWO things does the guide say about the river walk?","options":["A It is suitable for wheelchairs all the way.","B It takes about two hours.","C Visitors may see kingfishers near the footbridge.","D There is a tea room at the end.","E Dogs must be kept on a lead."],"correct":[2,4],"evidence":"That's where kingfishers nest","trap":["TR-ruledout","TR-paraphrase"],"why":{"en":"C \"That’s where kingfishers nest\" and E \"they must be kept on a lead\". Only the first mile suits wheelchairs, he says to allow three hours, and the tea room closed last winter.","tr":"C \"Yalıçapkınları orada yuva yapar\" ve E \"tasmalı tutulmaları gerekir\". Yalnızca ilk mil tekerlekli sandalyeye uygun, üç saat ayırmayı söylüyor ve çay salonu geçen kış kapandı.","fa":"C «همان‌جاست که ماهی‌خورک‌ها لانه می‌کنند» و E «باید با قلاده باشند». فقط مایل اول مناسب ویلچر است، می‌گوید سه ساعت وقت بگذارید و چایخانه زمستان گذشته بسته شد."}}]},{"instruction":"Questions 13-14. Choose TWO letters, A-E.","qtype":"mcq2","questions":[{"n":13,"n2":14,"kind":"mcq2","prompt":"Which TWO things does the guide say about the mill trail?","options":["A Visitors need to book a place.","B Children under twelve do not pay.","C A waterwheel can be seen working.","D Visitors can go inside Fenwick Mill.","E A guide leads the walk."],"correct":[1,2],"evidence":"children under twelve go free","trap":["TR-ruledout","TR-paraphrase"],"why":{"en":"B \"children under twelve go free\" and C \"volunteers start the old waterwheel every afternoon\". There is no booking and no guide, and Fenwick Mill is private flats.","tr":"B \"on iki yaş altı çocuklar ücretsiz\" ve C \"gönüllüler her öğleden sonra eski su çarkını çalıştırıyor\". Rezervasyon da rehber de yok; Fenwick Mill ise özel daireler.","fa":"B «بچه‌های زیر دوازده سال رایگان‌اند» و C «داوطلب‌ها هر بعدازظهر چرخ‌آبی قدیمی را راه می‌اندازند». نه رزرو لازم است نه راهنما، و Fenwick Mill آپارتمان خصوصی است."}}]},{"instruction":"Questions 15-20. Label the map below. Write the correct letter, A-I, next to Questions 15-20.","qtype":"map","bank":["A","B","C","D","E","F","G","H","I"],"questions":[{"n":15,"kind":"match","prompt":"Ticket office","correct":1,"evidence":"immediately on your right","why":{"en":"Through the main gate, \"the small brick building immediately on your right\": B. The shop is opposite, on the left.","tr":"Ana kapıdan girince \"hemen sağındaki küçük tuğla bina\": B. Dükkân karşısında, solda.","fa":"از در اصلی که وارد شوی «ساختمان آجری کوچک درست سمت راستت»: B. مغازه روبه‌رویش، سمت چپ است."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":16,"kind":"match","prompt":"Café","correct":3,"evidence":"It's at the top end of the warehouse, right next to the path","why":{"en":"\"It isn’t in the middle of it, as people tend to think.\" It is at the top end of the warehouse, next to the path: D.","tr":"\"İnsanların sandığı gibi ortasında değil.\" Deponun üst ucunda, yolun hemen yanında: D.","fa":"«آن‌طور که مردم فکر می‌کنند وسطش نیست». بالای انبار است، درست کنار مسیر: D."},"trap":["TR-ruledout"]},{"n":17,"kind":"match","prompt":"Boat trips","correct":6,"evidence":"right beside the lock, on its east side","why":{"en":"The toilets are west of the lock (F). Boat trips leave \"right beside the lock, on its east side\": G.","tr":"Tuvaletler kanal kilidinin batısında (F). Tekne turları \"kanal kilidinin hemen yanından, doğu tarafından\" kalkıyor: G.","fa":"دستشویی‌ها غرب آب‌بند هستند (F). قایق‌سواری «درست کنار آب‌بند، سمت شرقش» حرکت می‌کند: G."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":18,"kind":"match","prompt":"Children’s play area","correct":4,"evidence":"moved to the middle of the lawn","why":{"en":"It used to be next to the car park. It has been \"moved to the middle of the lawn\": E.","tr":"Eskiden otoparkın yanındaydı. \"Çimenliğin ortasına taşındı\": E.","fa":"قبلاً کنار پارکینگ بود. «به وسط چمن منتقل شده»: E."},"trap":["TR-ruledout"]},{"n":19,"kind":"match","prompt":"Blacksmith’s forge","correct":8,"evidence":"the blacksmith's forge is right there at the end of the bridge","why":{"en":"Cross the footbridge \"to the far bank\": the forge is at the end of the bridge, on the other side: I, not H.","tr":"Yaya köprüsünden \"karşı kıyıya\" geç: demirci köprünün ucunda, öbür tarafta: H değil, I.","fa":"از پل عابر «به آن طرف آب» برو: آهنگری انتهای پل، در طرف دیگر است: I، نه H."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":20,"kind":"match","prompt":"Picnic area","correct":2,"evidence":"the picnic area is on the west side of the warehouse","why":{"en":"\"On the west side of the warehouse, the side furthest from the path\": C.","tr":"\"Deponun batı tarafında, yola en uzak tarafta\": C.","fa":"«سمت غرب انبار، طرفی که از مسیر دورتر است»: C."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]}]}],"audio":{"voices":{"Announcer":{"accent":"British (standard Southern)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_george"},"role":"Recorded rubric"},"Guide":{"accent":"Northern English","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"piper","voice":"en_GB-northern_english_male-medium"},"role":"Visitor-centre guide"}},"sequence":[{"type":"announcer","text":"Part 2. You will hear a ranger at a visitor centre talking to a group of visitors about three ways to explore a valley. First, you have some time to look at Questions 11 to 14."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 11-14"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen carefully and answer Questions 11 to 14."},{"type":"sfx","note":"light outdoor background: a few birds, low murmur of a small group"},{"type":"lines","from":0,"to":6},{"type":"announcer","text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at Questions 15 to 20."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 15-20 (the map)"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen and answer Questions 15 to 20."},{"type":"lines","from":7,"to":14},{"type":"announcer","text":"That is the end of Part 2. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","after":30}]},"id":"c-x02-l2-d","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-02","unit":"x02-l2"},"exit":{"type":"exit","items":[{"tests":"word","point":1,"prompt":"A \"landing stage\" is a place where...","options":["visitors buy their tickets","boats stop so people can get on and off","trains wait before they leave"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"A landing stage is a small platform at the water where boats stop.","tr":"Landing stage, suyun kenarında teknelerin durduğu küçük bir iskeledir.","fa":"landing stage سکوی کوچکی کنار آب است که قایق‌ها آن‌جا می‌ایستند."}},{"tests":"paraphrase","point":3,"prompt":"An option says \"Visitors may see a rare bird.\" Which words in a talk match it?","options":["you’ve a good chance of spotting a heron","there used to be herons here","the heron is just the name of the café"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"\"A good chance of spotting\" = you may see. The other two rule the bird out.","tr":"\"Görme şansın yüksek\" = görebilirsin. Diğer ikisi kuşu dışarıda bırakıyor.","fa":"«شانس خوبی برای دیدن داری» یعنی ممکن است ببینی. دو گزینه‌ی دیگر پرنده را رد می‌کنند."}},{"tests":"method","point":2,"prompt":"On the map, the speaker is walking down the page (south) and says \"turn left\". Which way do you go on the map?","options":["to the left of the page (west)","up the page (north)","to the right of the page (east)"],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"Facing south, your left is east, which is the right of the page. Follow the speaker’s direction, not your own.","tr":"Güneye bakarken solun doğudur, yani sayfanın sağı. Kendi yönünü değil, konuşanın yönünü takip et.","fa":"وقتی رو به جنوب هستی، چپِ تو شرق است، یعنی سمت راست صفحه. جهت گوینده را دنبال کن، نه جهت خودت را."}},{"tests":"trap","point":3,"prompt":"\"The trail is free for children, but adults pay three pounds.\" An option says \"The trail is free for everyone.\" Is the option right?","options":["Yes: it is free","No: only children go free","The talk does not say"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"Only part of the option matches. Adults pay, so \"free for everyone\" is wrong.","tr":"Seçeneğin yalnızca bir kısmı uyuyor. Yetişkinler ödüyor, yani \"herkes için ücretsiz\" yanlış.","fa":"فقط بخشی از گزینه جور است. بزرگسال‌ها پول می‌دهند، پس «برای همه رایگان» غلط است."}},{"tests":"method","point":1,"prompt":"A map task has nine letters, A-I, and six questions. How many letters will you not use?","options":["three","none","six"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"Six places, nine letters: three letters are extra.","tr":"Altı yer, dokuz harf: üç harf fazladan.","fa":"شش مکان، نُه حرف: سه حرف اضافه‌اند."}}],"id":"c-x02-l2-x","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-02","unit":"x02-l2"}}; })(globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS = globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS || {});
